# Oracle Applications - Queries Úteis

Repositório destinado ao armazenamento de scripts SQL para administração e suporte do Oracle E-Business Suite (EBS).

## 🚀 Consulta de Responsabilidades por Usuário

Esta query é essencial para processos de auditoria e troubleshooting de acessos. Ela lista todas as responsabilidades vinculadas a um determinado `USERNAME`, trazendo o contexto contábil (Set of Books).

/*
  LISTA RESPONSABILIDADES POR USUÁRIO (ORACLE EBS)
  -----------------------------------------------
  Retorna as responsabilidades atribuídas a um usuário específico,
  incluindo o Set of Books (SOB) associado via perfil.
*/

SELECT UNIQUE 
    u.user_id, 
    SUBSTR(u.user_name, 1, 30)           AS user_name,
    SUBSTR(r.responsibility_name, 1, 60) AS responsiblity,
    SUBSTR(a.application_name, 1, 50)    AS application,
    r.responsibility_id,
    fpov.profile_option_value            AS sob
FROM 
    APPS.fnd_user u,
    APPS.fnd_user_resp_groups g,
    APPS.fnd_application_tl a,
    APPS.fnd_responsibility_tl r,
    APPS.fnd_profile_options fpo, 
    APPS.fnd_profile_option_values fpov
WHERE 
    g.user_id(+) = u.user_id
    AND g.responsibility_application_id = a.application_id
    AND a.application_id = r.application_id
    AND g.responsibility_id = r.responsibility_id
    AND u.user_id = (SELECT user_id FROM APPS.fnd_user WHERE user_name = '&USERNAME')
    AND fpov.profile_option_id = fpo.profile_option_id
    AND fpov.level_value = r.responsibility_id
    AND fpo.profile_option_name = 'GL_SET_OF_BKS_NAME'
ORDER BY 
    user_name,
    application,
    responsiblity;
